==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 7.33 seconds<sup>220f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 2~14 seconds<sup>60f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 20.67 seconds<sup>620f</sup>, delay 10~10.67 seconds<sup>300f~320f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>, delay 10~10.67 seconds<sup>300f~320f</sup>.
*2 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*2 [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Snache]] spawns after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Despite not being released outside BCTW, in the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese]] game files the stage is codenamed as '''TWその1'''.

